===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|recreacion}}, from {{der|en|frm|recreacion}}, from {{der|en|fro|recreacion}}, from {{der|en|la|recreātiō}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{enPR|rĕ-krē-āʹshən|a=UK}}, {{IPA|en|/ɹɛkɹiˈeɪʃən/}}
** {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-recreation (fun).wav|a=Southern England}}
