{{wp}}

====Noun====
{{en-noun|~}}

# Any [[activity]], such as [[play]], that [[amuse]]s, [[divert]]s or [[stimulate]]s.
#* {{RQ:Burton Melancholy|edition=2nd|part=II|section=2|member=4|passage=The ordinary '''recreations''' which we have in winter, and in most solitary times busy our minds with, are cards, tables and dice, shovelboard, chess-play, the philosopher's game, small trunks, shuttlecock {{...}}}}
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1972|author=Peter Chan|title=Water quality and recreational value analysis on Lake Dubay
|passage=Mercury contents did not affect '''recreation''' persay but definitely could if found in fish tissue at high levels.}}

